     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorDataDictionary</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorDataDictionary\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorDataDictionary\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"DICT-01\"> </a></b>Define data elements from workflows</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can define data elements required throughout different points of the workflow for service delivery and indicator reporting.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"DICT-02\"> </a></b>Apply data capture criteria</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can apply the criterion that only data needed for reporting, auditing, decision-support, aggregation, or exchange should be captured.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"DICT-03\"> </a></b>Map to standard terminologies</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can map data elements to standards-based classifications and terminologies (ICD, LOINC, SNOMED).</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"DICT-04\"> </a></b>Identify and remove duplicates</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can identify duplicate data elements and consolidate Boolean data elements into List data elements where appropriate.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"DICT-05\"> </a></b>Fill data dictionary template</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can complete the standardized DAK data dictionary spreadsheet template with detailed data specifications.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorDataDictionary</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorDataDictionary\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorDataDictionary\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-DICT-01\"> </a></b>Define data elements from workflows</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can define data elements required throughout different points of the workflow for service delivery and indicator reporting.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-DICT-02\"> </a></b>Apply data capture criteria</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can apply the criterion that only data needed for reporting, auditing, decision-support, aggregation, or exchange should be captured.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-DICT-03\"> </a></b>Map to standard terminologies</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can map data elements to standards-based classifications and terminologies (ICD, LOINC, SNOMED).</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-DICT-04\"> </a></b>Identify and remove duplicates</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can identify duplicate data elements and consolidate Boolean data elements into List data elements where appropriate.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-DICT-05\"> </a></b>Fill data dictionary template</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can complete the standardized DAK data dictionary spreadsheet template with detailed data specifications.</